depends 2180base
use main
send 1
a1 store 1:* +flags \deleted
receive 5
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
* 2 FETCH (UID 2 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent \Seen))
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
* 4 FETCH (UID 4 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
a1 OK done
use watcher
send 1
w noop
receive 5
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS (\Deleted))
* 2 FETCH (UID 2 FLAGS (\Deleted \Seen))
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS (\Deleted))
* 4 FETCH (UID 4 FLAGS (\Deleted))
w OK done
use main
send 1
a2 search undeleted
use watcher
send 1
d expunge
use main
receive 2
* SEARCH
a2 OK done
use watcher
receive 5
* 1 EXPUNGE
* 1 EXPUNGE
* 1 EXPUNGE
* 1 EXPUNGE
d OK done
end
